<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BOURSE TURNOVER FALLS TO HUF 9.081 BLN.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BOURSE TURNOVER FALLS TO HUF 9.081 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover fell to 9.081 billion forints on Thursday from a record of 12.906 billion forints on Wednesday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
